{# ---- HONEST DISCLOSURE (portfolio, not tips) ---- #}
<div class="disc warn">
  <b>{{ t('Read this as a portfolio, not stock tips.','请把它当作组合，而非个股建议。') }}</b>
  <ul>
    <li>{{ t('Per-name drawdowns are deep — the validated construction saw','单只回撤很深——已验证构造的历史') }}
