      {{ t('reconstructed on the current plane, which under-represents delisted / dropped names (survivorship). The forward ledger is the real record.','在当前面板上重建，低估了退市/剔除的名称（幸存者偏差）。前瞻记录簿才是真实记录。') }}</li>
  </ul>
</div>

{# ---- W5-B: SURVIVORSHIP-HONEST RE-DERIVATION BLOCK (ABOVE the upper-bound backcast) ---- #}
{# Sources: research/china_alpha/w5/w5a_rederive_stats.json (committed, emitted by            #}
{# scripts/china_reversal_rederive_phase0.py). Absent file = block omitted, no crash.         #}
{% set rd = d.rederive_stats %}
{% if rd %}
{% set rp = rd.primary.full %}
{% set re = rd.primary.early %}
{% set rl = rd.primary.late %}
{% set rp24 = rd.primary.post_2024 %}
<div class="rederive" id="rederive-block">
  <div class="rd-head">{{ t('Survivorship-honest re-derivation (W5-A)','幸存者偏差修正后再推导（W5-A）') }}</div>
  <p class="rd-sub">{{ t(
    'The re-derived number on the survivorship-clean(er) RAW plane (data/china_stocks_raw — RAW/unadjusted, 1990–2026, append-only). This replaces the unreproducible 0.58 Sharpe as the honest headline. The trimmed-plane backcast below is an upper bound; these numbers are the tighter, more honest estimate.',
    '在幸存者偏差更小的原始价格面板（data/china_stocks_raw — 原始未复权，1990–2026，追加写入）上再推导的数值。本结果取代了无法复现的0.58夏普，作为诚实的标题统计。下方的裁剪面板回测为上界；本区块数据是更严格、更诚实的估计。') }}</p>
  <span class="rd-verdict">{{ rd.verdict }}</span>
  <div class="rd-grid">
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('long-leg spread (universe-rel.)','多腿超额（相对等权宇宙）') }} <b>{% if rp.mean_pct is not none %}+{{ '%.3f'|format(rp.mean_pct) }}%/reb{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">NW-HAC t <b>{% if rp.t_hac is not none %}{{ '%.2f'|format(rp.t_hac) }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('ann. Sharpe','年化夏普') }} <b>{% if rp.sharpe is not none %}{{ '%.2f'|format(rp.sharpe) }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('n rebalances','再平衡次数') }} <b>{% if rp.n is not none %}{{ rp.n }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('hit rate','胜率') }} <b>{% if rp.hit is not none %}{{ '%.1f'|format(rp.hit * 100) }}%{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('maxDD (universe-rel.)','最大回撤（相对等权宇宙）') }} <span class="neg">{% if rp.maxdd_pct is not none %}{{ '%.1f'|format(rp.maxdd_pct) }}%{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</span></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('fill tax','成交税') }} <b>{% if rd.fill_tax.close_to_close_pct is not none and rd.fill_tax.fill_realistic_pct is not none %}{{ '%.3f'|format(rd.fill_tax.close_to_close_pct) }}% c2c vs {{ '%.3f'|format(rd.fill_tax.fill_realistic_pct) }}% T+1{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('placebo perm_p','随机置换p值') }} <b>{% if rd.placebo.perm_p is not none %}{{ '%.4f'|format(rd.placebo.perm_p) }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
  </div>
  <div class="rd-grid">
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('early half','前半段') }} <b>{% if re.mean_pct is not none %}{{ '%+.3f'|format(re.mean_pct) }}%/reb, t {{ '%.2f'|format(re.t_hac) }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('late half','后半段') }} <b>{% if rl.mean_pct is not none %}{{ '%+.3f'|format(rl.mean_pct) }}%/reb, t {{ '%.2f'|format(rl.t_hac) }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</b></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('per-name p1 drawdown','个股p1回撤') }} <span class="neg">{% if rd.per_name_drawdown.p1_pct is not none %}{{ '%.1f'|format(rd.per_name_drawdown.p1_pct) }}%{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</span></span>
    <span class="rd-stat">{{ t('per-name p5 drawdown','个股p5回撤') }} <span class="neg">{% if rd.per_name_drawdown.p5_pct is not none %}{{ '%.1f'|format(rd.per_name_drawdown.p5_pct) }}%{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</span></span>
  </div>
  {% if rp24 and rp24.mean_pct is not none and rp24.mean_pct < 0 %}
  <div class="rd-warn">{{ t(
    '2024+ caveat: the most recent 29-rebalance tail is negative (',
    '2024+注意：最近29次再平衡尾部为负（') }}{{ '%+.3f'|format(rp24.mean_pct) }}%/reb, t {{ '%.2f'|format(rp24.t_hac) }}{{ t(') — CONFIRM keys on the two time-halves per pre-registration; the forward ledger adjudicates whether this is noise or a regime change.',') — CONFIRM依据的是前后两半段（依预登记），前瞻台账将裁定这是噪声还是机制变化。') }}</div>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="rd-ub">{{ t(
    'UPPER BOUND on the available plane: both substrates are pure-survivor on the delisting axis (0 of 1,469 raw names end before the panel max). The reversal signal buys the deepest decliners — precisely the population most likely to contain eventual delistings. True out-of-sample number is at or below this one. Substrate repair (PIT membership store retaining delisted-name terminal returns) is an F9/W1 task; until then every reversal number stays labeled an upper bound.',
    '可用面板上的上界：两个底层数据库均在退市轴上为纯幸存者（1,469只原始标的中0只在面板最新日之前结束）。反转信号买入的是跌幅最深的标的——正是最可能包含最终退市标的的群体。真实样本外数值等于或低于此数。底层数据修复（保留退市标的最终回报的时点成分库）是F9/W1任务；在此之前，所有反转数字保持标注为上界。') }}</div>
</div>
{% endif %}

{# ---- BACKCAST NAV vs CSI300 (trimmed-plane reconstruction, upper bound) ---- #}
<div class="sec"><h2>{{ t('Trimmed-plane reconstruction (upper bound) — NAV vs CSI300','裁剪面板重建（上界）——净值 vs 沪深300') }}</h2>
  <span class="cnt">{% if d.backcast %}{{ d.backcast.n_legs }} {{ t('rebalances','次再平衡') }} · {{ d.backcast.months }}m{% endif %}</span></div>
<p class="sub">{{ t('Reconstruction of the trailing ~24 monthly rebalances on the trimmed china_search plane (upper-bound plane — survivorship- and adjustment-inflated vs the raw-plane re-derivation above). Clearly marked reconstruction, not a live record. See the honest re-derivation block above for the tighter number.','在裁剪后的 china_search 面板（上界面板——相比上方原始面板再推导结果存在幸存者偏差与调整价膨胀）上重建近约24次月度再平衡。明确标注为重建，而非真实记录。更严格的数据见上方诚实再推导区块。') }}</p>
{% if d.backcast and d.backcast.nav and d.backcast.nav.dates|length > 1 %}
{% set nav = d.backcast.nav %}
{% set allv = nav.sleeve + nav.csi300 %}
{% set vmax = allv|max %}{% set vmin = allv|min %}
{% set span = (vmax - vmin) if (vmax - vmin) > 0 else 1 %}
{% set W = 940 %}{% set H = 210 %}{% set n = nav.dates|length %}
<div class="nav-wrap">
  <div class="nav-legend">
    <span class="k"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--up)"></span>{{ t('Sleeve','组合') }}</span>
    <span class="k"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--muted)"></span>{{ t('CSI300','沪深300') }}</span>
    <span class="k">{{ t('start = 1.00','起点=1.00') }}</span>
  </div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 {{ W }} {{ H }}" width="100%" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img"
       aria-label="Sleeve NAV versus CSI300">
    <line x1="0" y1="{{ H }}" x2="{{ W }}" y2="{{ H }}" stroke="var(--line)"/>
    {# baseline at NAV=1.0 #}
    {% set y1 = (H - ((1.0 - vmin) / span) * (H - 14) - 7) %}
    <line x1="0" y1="{{ '%.1f'|format(y1) }}" x2="{{ W }}" y2="{{ '%.1f'|format(y1) }}" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/>
    {% set pts_b = [] %}
    {% for v in nav.csi300 %}{% set x = loop.index0 / (n-1) * W %}{% set y = H - ((v - vmin)/span)*(H-14) - 7 %}{% set _ = pts_b.append('%.1f,%.1f'|format(x, y)) %}{% endfor %}
    <polyline fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.6" points="{{ pts_b|join(' ') }}"/>
    {% set pts_s = [] %}
    {% for v in nav.sleeve %}{% set x = loop.index0 / (n-1) * W %}{% set y = H - ((v - vmin)/span)*(H-14) - 7 %}{% set _ = pts_s.append('%.1f,%.1f'|format(x, y)) %}{% endfor %}
    <polyline fill="none" stroke="var(--up)" stroke-width="2.1" points="{{ pts_s|join(' ') }}"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="bc-stats">
    <span>{{ t('excess / mo','月度超额') }} {{ signed(d.backcast.excess_mo_pct, pct=true) }}</span>
    <span>{{ t('Sharpe (ann.)','夏普(年化)') }} <b>{{ d.backcast.sharpe if d.backcast.sharpe is not none else '—' }}</b></span>
    <span>{{ t('max drawdown','最大回撤') }} <span class="neg">{{ '%.1f'|format(d.backcast.maxdd_pct) }}%</span></span>
    <span>{{ t('hit','胜率') }} <b>{{ d.backcast.hit_pct }}%</b></span>
    <span>{{ t('graded on','评分基准') }} <code>{{ d.backcast.graded_on }}</code></span>
  </div>
  <div class="bc-stats">
    <span>{{ t('Original reference (1990→2026, upper bound — see re-derivation above for honest number)','原始参考（1990→2026，上界——诚实数据见上方再推导区块）') }}:
      {{ t('excess','超额') }} <b>+{{ d.reference.excess_mo_pct }}%/mo</b> ·
      Sharpe <b>{{ d.reference.sharpe }}</b> · maxDD <span class="neg">{{ d.reference.maxdd_pct }}%</span> ·
      {{ t('hit','胜率') }} <b>{{ d.reference.hit_pct }}%</b> · n={{ d.reference.n_rebalances }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="pass">{{ t('Passport','护照') }}: basis <code>{{ d.presentation.passport.basis }}</code> ·
    frame <code>{{ d.presentation.passport.frame }}</code> · n <code>{{ d.presentation.passport.n }}</code> ·
    <span class="neg">{{ t('UPPER BOUND','上界') }}</span> · {{ d.backcast.caveat }}</p>
</div>
{% else %}
<div class="empty">{{ t('Backcast unavailable (plane too short).','回测不可用（面板过短）。') }}</div>
{% endif %}

{# ---- FORWARD LEDGER (the real record) ---- #}
<div class="sec"><h2>{{ t('Forward ledger — the real record','前瞻记录簿——真实记录') }}</h2>
  <span class="cnt">{{ d.ledger.rows }} {{ t('rows','行') }}</span></div>
<p class="sub">{{ t('Every rebalance is registered to its own point-in-time parquet and graded CSI300-relative, fill-realistic (T+1, locked-limit excluded). This is what the sleeve is judged on — not the backcast.','每次再平衡都登记到自有的时点parquet，并按沪深300相对、真实成交（T+1、排除一字板）评分。组合以此为准——而非回测。') }}</p>
{% set lg = (d.ledger.graded or {}).get('graded') or {} %}
{% if lg.get('mean_excess_per_rebalance') is not none %}
<div class="bc-stats">
  <span>{{ t('rebalances graded','已评分再平衡') }} <b>{{ lg.n_rebalances }}</b></span>
  <span>{{ t('mean excess / rebalance','每次超额均值') }} {{ signed((lg.mean_excess_per_rebalance*100), pct=true) }}</span>
  <span>{{ t('hit vs CSI300','对沪深300胜率') }} <b>{{ (lg.hit_vs_csi300*100)|round(1) }}%</b></span>
</div>
{% else %}
<div class="empty">{{ t('Accruing — the sleeve grades once enough rebalances mature (conventions locked in from day 1).','累积中——待足够再平衡成熟后开始评分（评分惯例自第一天锁定）。') }}
  <code>n={{ lg.get('n_rebalances', 0) }}</code></div>
{% endif %}
<p class="pass">{{ t('Conventions','惯例') }}: <code>{{ d.ledger.conventions }}</code> · <code>{{ d.ledger.artifact }}</code></p>

{# ---- CURRENT MEMBERSHIP ---- #}
<div class="sec"><h2>{{ t('Current membership','当前成分') }}</h2>
  <span class="cnt">{{ d.n_members }} {{ t('names','只') }} · {{ t('EW','等权') }} · {{ t('no gate','无门槛') }}</span></div>
<p class="sub">{{ t('Deepest-quintile within-sector 3M reversal fuel (rev_z). Universe hygiene only: ST fail-closed, real-mktcap floor, ADV floor. Context chips are DISPLAY ONLY — they do NOT affect membership or weights.','同板块3个月反转燃料最深五分位（rev_z）。仅做基础净化：ST一律排除、真实市值下限、成交额下限。上下文标签仅供展示——不影响成分或权重。') }}
  <br>{{ t('screened out','已筛除') }}: ST {{ d.screened.st }} · {{ t('mcap','市值') }} {{ d.screened.mcap }} · ADV {{ d.screened.adv }}</p>
{% if d.members %}
<table>
  <thead><tr>
    <th>#</th><th>{{ t('Ticker','代码') }}</th><th>{{ t('Name','名称') }}</th><th>{{ t('Sector','行业') }}</th>
    <th class="num">rev_z</th><th class="num">{{ t('3M ret','3月涨幅') }}</th>
    <th class="num">{{ t('sec rank','行业排名') }}</th><th class="num">{{ t('mcap 亿','市值亿') }}</th><th class="num">{{ t('wt','权重') }}</th>
  </tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for m in d.members %}
  <tr>
    <td class="num">{{ loop.index }}</td>
    <td class="tk">{{ m.ticker }}</td>
    <td>{{ m.name }}
      {% if m.context_chips %}
      <div class="chips">
        {% for dm in m.context_chips.demotions or [] %}<span class="chip warn" title="{{ dm.measured }}">{{ t(dm.label_en, dm.label_zh) }}</span>{% endfor %}
        {% if m.context_chips.probationary %}{% for k, pv in m.context_chips.probationary.items() %}<span class="chip prob" title="{{ pv.passport.measured if pv.passport else '' }}">{{ k }}</span>{% endfor %}{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </td>
    <td>{{ m.sector }}</td>
    <td class="num revz">{{ '%.2f'|format(m.rev_z) }}</td>
    <td class="num">{{ signed(m.ret_3m, pct=true, dp=1) }}</td>
    <td class="num">{{ m.sector_rank }}/{{ m.sector_n }}</td>
    <td class="num">{{ m.mktcap_yi|round|int if m.mktcap_yi is not none else '—' }}</td>
    <td class="num">{{ (m.weight*100)|round(2) }}%</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="empty">{{ t('No members today (plane unavailable).','今日无成分（面板不可用）。') }}</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="foot">
  {{ t('Reversal Sleeve — monthly-rebalanced contrarian basket. A portfolio, NOT stock tips; high variance, size small.','反转组合 — 按月再平衡的逆向篮子。这是一个组合，不是个股建议；高波动，宜小仓位。') }}
  · <code>site/factordata/cn_reversal_sleeve.json</code> ·
  {{ t('built','构建于') }} {{ built }} ·
  {{ t('W5-B: page promoted from shadow (CONFIRM verdict, 2026-07-03). Honest headline from survivorship-clean(er) raw-plane re-derive; forward ledger is the real record.','W5-B：页面已从影子状态升级（CONFIRM裁决，2026-07-03）。诚实标题数据来自幸存者偏差更小的原始面板再推导；前瞻台账是真实记录。') }}
</div>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
